{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"SNG","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"雅歌","commonName":"雅歌","title":"雅歌","order":22,"numberOfChapters":8,"sha256":"820389c30d8a5130337eaf73a3bc30375c6a468dc71a42108db52533b55d6738","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/SNG/1.json","lastChapterNumber":8,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/SNG/8.json","totalNumberOfVerses":117},"chapter":{"number":8,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"如果你是我的同胞兄弟就好了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這樣，在外頭遇見你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也可以親吻你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有人會取笑我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我可以把你帶進教養我的母親家。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要給你喝石榴汁釀的醇酒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的左手扶著我的頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的右手緊抱著我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷的少女啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我吩咐你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要叫醒或驚動愛情，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"等它自發吧。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"那從曠野上來、靠在良人身旁的是誰呢？","poem":1},"女子：",{"text":"我在蘋果樹下喚醒你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你母親在那裡懷你養你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為你受生產之苦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"請把我印在你的心上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"刻在你的手臂上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為愛情如死亡一般堅固，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"嫉妒像陰間一樣殘酷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它燃起的火焰是燒滅一切的烈火。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愛情，大水不能熄滅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"江河不能淹沒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若有人想傾其家財買愛情，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必遭唾棄。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"我們有一個小妹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的胸還沒有發育。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若有人來提親，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們該怎麼辦？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她若是牆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們要在上面建造銀塔；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她若是門，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們要用香柏木板圍護她。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"我是一面牆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的雙乳像城樓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在他眼中像找到平安的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所羅門在巴力·哈們有一個葡萄園，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他把葡萄園租給看守的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"租金是每人一千塊銀子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的葡萄園，我自己作主。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所羅門啊，你的一千塊銀子自己留著，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"二百塊銀子給管果園的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"你這住在園中的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"同伴們都在聆聽你的聲音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你讓我也聽見吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"我的良人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願你像香草山上的羚羊和小鹿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"快快來到我身邊！","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/SNG/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/SNG/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}